 mellitus in middle-aged persons</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>2002</year><volume>287</volume><fpage>2528</fpage><lpage>2533</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.287.19.2528</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12020333</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Burke</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Virmani</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Galis</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Haudenschild</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Muller</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>34th Bethesda Conference: Task force #2&#x02013;What is the pathologic basis for new atherosclerosis imaging techniques?</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><year>2003</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>1874</fpage><lpage>1886</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0735-1097(03)00359-0</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12798554</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Burke</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Farb</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Malcom</surname><given-names>GT</given-names></name><name><surname>Liang</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Smialek</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Virmani</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of risk factors on the mechanism of acute thrombosis and sudden coronary death in women</article-title><source>Circulation</source><year>1998</year><volume>97</volume><fpage>2110</fpage><lpage>2116</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1161/01.CIR.97.21.2110</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9626170</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reynolds</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name><name><surname>Srichai</surname><given-names>MB</given-names></name><name><surname>Iqbal</surname><given-names>SN</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Mechanisms of myocardial infarction in women without angiographically obstructive coronary artery disease</article-title><source>Circulation</source><year>2011</year><volume>124</volume><fpage>1414</fpage><lpage>1425</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.111.026542</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21900087</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR13"><label>13.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nicholls</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolski</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Sipahi</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Rate of progression of coronary atherosclerotic plaque in women</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>1546</fpage><lpage>1551</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jacc.2006.12.039</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17418293</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR14"><label>14.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shaw</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Bugiardini</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Merz</surname><given-names>CN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Women and ischemic heart disease: evolving knowledge</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><year>2009</year><volume>54</volume><fpage>1561</fpage><lpage>1575</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jacc.2009.04.098</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type